// RDP Session Hijack via tscon
// Detects tscon.exe connecting a session to another destination. Run as SYSTEM it takes over another user's disconnected RDP session without their password.
// techniques: T1563.002   severity: high   status: experimental
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1563.002
//   query user
//   sc create sesshijack binpath= "cmd.exe /k tscon 2 /dest:rdp-tcp#0" && net start sesshijack
// source: rules/lateral-movement/rdp-session-hijack-tscon.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
Event
| where ((NewProcessName endswith @"\tscon.exe") and (CommandLine contains @"/dest:"))
